{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin to strike in a deckbuilding roguelike with a slot machine as your Dungeon Master.. Load the reels with weapons, coins, and cursed relics, then let fate drive the fight. Each spin triggers attacks, abilities, and effects as you battle. Build your deck, tweak your odds, and hope the machine is feeling generous.<br><br>The Machine starts out with minimal items in its deck, as you play you unlock new items to add to the reels. Currently there is 30 items to unlock and explore, 10 Enemy types to fight and several bosses to battle.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2462430?t=1756925712","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462430/610fc3c40683defab72baf989275cc3409a81b95/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756925712","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462430/d03385a3734c8b9dce160843b0aa49da3badbb26/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756925712","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462430/d03385a3734c8b9dce160843b0aa49da3badbb26/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756925712","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin to strike in a deckbuilding roguelike with a slot machine as your Dungeon Master.. Load the reels with weapons, coins, and cursed relics, then let fate drive the fight. Each spin triggers attacks, abilities, and effects as you battle. Build your deck, tweak your odds, and hope the machine is feeling generous.<br><br>The Machine starts out with minimal items in its deck, as you play you unlock new items to add to the reels. Currently there is 30 items to unlock and explore, 10 Enemy types to fight and several bosses to battle.</p>","develop